[37mFixed. Here's[0m[37m what was wrong and what I[0m[37m did.[0m

[34m##[0m[37m [0m[34mRoot cause[0m

[37mYour[0m[37m system-wide[0m[37m interpreter[0m[37m is a[0m[37m source[0m[37m-built [0m[1;33m**[0m[1;33mPython 3.13.1[0m[1;33m**[0m[37m at [0m[32m`[0m[32m/usr/local/bin/python3[0m[32m`[0m[37m, with[0m[37m site-packages at[0m[37m [0m[32m`[0m[32m/usr/local/lib/python3.13/site-packages[0m[32m`[0m[37m.[0m

[37mIn[0m[37m that directory, only[0m[37m these[0m[37m were[0m[37m present:[0m

[37m```[0m
[37mREADME[0m[37m.txt[0m
[37mpip-[0m[37m24.3.1.d[0m[37mist-info/     ← metadata[0m[37m intact[0m
[37m```[0m

[37mThe[0m[37m [0m[32m`[0m[32mpip-24.3.1.dist-info[0m[32m`[0m[37m folder was there[0m[37m, but the[0m[37m [0m[1;33m**[0m[1;33mactual [0m[1;32m`[0m[1;32mpip/[0m[1;32m`[0m[1;33m package directory had been deleted[0m[1;33m**[0m[37m.[0m[37m Its REC[0m[37mORD file[0m[37m still[0m[37m listed all[0m[37m 852 installed[0m[37m files, so this[0m[37m was a partial[0m[37m/f[0m[37mailed uninstall ([0m[37mor an interrupted upgrade[0m[37m)[0m[37m that[0m[37m removed the code[0m[37m but left the metadata behind[0m[37m.[0m

[37mThat[0m[37m produced[0m[37m the[0m[37m confusing symptom[0m[37m:[0m

[37m```[0m
[37m$ pip[0m[37m --version[0m
[37mTrace[0m[37mback (most recent call last[0m[37m):[0m
[37m  File "/usr/local[0m[37m/bin/pip", line [0m[37m5, in [0m[37m<[0m[31mmodule[0m[37m>[0m
[37m    from pip.[0m[35m_[0m[35minternal.cli.main import main[0m
[35mModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'pip'[0m
